   SECURITY AND ACCEPTABLE USE
   You must not: (a) attempt to gain unauthorised access to the website's
   servers, database, hosting or domain accounts; (b) probe, scan or test the
   website's security, or run automated attacks, spam or bulk form submissions
   against it, without written permission from NDR EdTech; (c) disrupt or
   overload the service; or (d) access, copy or disclose enquiry data
   submitted by visitors. Security researchers acting in good faith who report
   a vulnerability privately (see AUTHORS) and do not access or keep personal
   data will not be pursued for that report. Passwords, API keys, database
   credentials and server configuration files are confidential and must never
   be committed to this repository.

